Transaction-related tables first (most dependent)
transaction_details
transaction_lines
Budgets
budget_lines
budgets
Tasks (if they reference transactions or accounts)
Accounts & Funds
accounts
funds
Categories (usually safe)
natural_categories
functional_categories
This order minimizes foreign key constraint issues.

Best practice for this tool:

Use TRUNCATE TABLE with CASCADE if your database supports it (MariaDB/MySQL does in most cases).
Or temporarily disable foreign key checks during the clear operation.
